    "What do you need to remember?" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "¿Qué necesitas recordar?" } } } },
    "Title (e.g. Take my pills)" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Título (p. ej. Tomar mis pastillas)" } } } },
    "Notes (optional)" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Notas (opcional)" } } } },
    "Look" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Estilo" } } } },
    "Who is this for?" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "¿Para quién es?" } } } },
    "Me / always" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Para mí / siempre" } } } },
    "Add people or pets with week patterns in the People & Pets section — then routines linked to them only remind you on the days they're with you." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añade personas o mascotas con patrones de semanas en Personas y Mascotas: las rutinas vinculadas solo te avisarán los días que estén contigo." } } } },
    "Linked routines only remind you on days that person or pet is with you." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Las rutinas vinculadas solo te avisan los días que esa persona o mascota está contigo." } } } },
    "How often?" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "¿Con qué frecuencia?" } } } },
    "Repeat" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Repetir" } } } },
    "Counted from the start date below — great for every-other-day pet pills." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Contado desde la fecha de inicio: ideal para pastillas en días alternos." } } } },
    "Which days?" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "¿Qué días?" } } } },
    "Pick at least one day, or this routine would never happen." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Elige al menos un día o esta rutina nunca ocurrirá." } } } },
    "Which days of the month?" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "¿Qué días del mes?" } } } },
    "In shorter months, days 29–31 fall on the last day of the month." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "En meses más cortos, los días 29–31 caen en el último día del mes." } } } },
    "Date" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fecha" } } } },
    "Starts" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Empieza" } } } },
    "Ends" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Termina" } } } },
    "End date" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Fecha de fin" } } } },
    "Time" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Hora" } } } },
    "Add another time" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añadir otra hora" } } } },
    "Times of day" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Horas del día" } } } },
    "Add several times for things like morning and evening pills. Swipe to delete a time; delete all for an any-time task (its reminder uses the any-time hour from Settings)." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añade varias horas, por ejemplo pastillas de mañana y de noche. Desliza para borrar una hora; bórralas todas para una tarea sin hora fija (su aviso usa la hora configurada en Ajustes)." } } } },
    "Alert" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Aviso" } } } },
    "Alarm mode sends a time-sensitive alert (it can break through Focus when Time Sensitive notifications are allowed) and re-alerts every %lld min, %lld times, until you mark it done. It follows the ring/silent switch." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "El modo alarma envía una alerta urgente (puede atravesar los modos de concentración si las notificaciones urgentes están permitidas) y vuelve a avisar cada %lld min, %lld veces, hasta que la marques como hecha. Respeta el interruptor de silencio." } } } },
    "Notifications are turned off for this app, so this routine can't alert you. Allow them in iOS Settings." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Las notificaciones están desactivadas para esta app, así que esta rutina no podrá avisarte. Actívalas en Ajustes de iOS." } } } },
    "Open iOS Settings" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Abrir Ajustes de iOS" } } } },
    "Step" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Paso" } } } },
    "Add a step (e.g. Morning pill)" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añade un paso (p. ej. Pastilla de la mañana)" } } } },
    "Add checklist step" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añadir paso a la lista" } } } },
    "Checklist (optional)" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Lista (opcional)" } } } },
    "Break the routine into steps you tick off one by one — e.g. each pill in the morning batch, or homework subjects. Leave empty for a single checkbox." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Divide la rutina en pasos que marcas uno a uno, p. ej. cada pastilla de la mañana o cada asignatura. Déjala vacía para una única casilla." } } } },
    "Back" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Atrás" } } } },
    "Next" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Siguiente" } } } },
    "Save Changes" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Guardar cambios" } } } },
    "Create Routine" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Crear rutina" } } } },
    "Couldn't save" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No se pudo guardar" } } } },
    "Something went wrong saving this routine. Please try again." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Algo salió mal al guardar esta rutina. Inténtalo de nuevo." } } } },
    "OK" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "OK" } } } },
    "No people or pets yet" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Aún no hay personas ni mascotas" } } } },
    "Add someone with a week pattern — like a child or pet on alternating custody weeks — and link routines to them so reminders only fire on the right weeks." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añade a alguien con un patrón de semanas —como un peque o una mascota en custodia alterna— y vincula rutinas para que los avisos solo lleguen las semanas correctas." } } } },
    "Add Person or Pet" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añadir persona o mascota" } } } },
    "People & Pets" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Personas y Mascotas" } } } },
    "Add person or pet" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Añadir persona o mascota" } } } },
    "Delete and keep routines (they'll repeat on all days)" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Eliminar y conservar rutinas (se repetirán todos los días)" } } } },
    "Delete with their routines" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Eliminar junto con sus rutinas" } } } },
    "Delete %@? %lld linked routine(s) would then repeat on ALL days." : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "¿Eliminar a %@? %lld rutina(s) vinculada(s) pasarían a repetirse TODOS los días." } } } },
    "Delete %@?" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "¿Eliminar a %@?" } } } },
    "%lld linked routine(s)" : { "localizations" : { "es" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%lld rutina(s) vinculada(s)" } } } },
